## 657: determine both [x] and {x} in each case

a. x=65.4 lies in [65,66[. Therefore [x]=65 and
   {x}=65.4-65=0.4. Both requested quantities are (65,0.4).

b. x=-65.4 lies in [-66,-65[. Therefore [x]=-66 and
   {x}=-65.4-(-66)=0.6. Both requested quantities are (-66,0.6).

The reconstructions 65+0.4=65.4 and -66+0.6=-65.4 check the decomposition,
and each fractional component lies in [0,1[. No sign is discarded.

